  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): third text-pipeline helper feeding the untyped sketch_precomputed dict (cli.py:8060); sketch.py:_extract_domain_vocabulary uses raw Counter.most_common(12) with no plural collapse and no analysis-domain stop-list (_COMMON_TERMS only filters generic CS terms). Same theme as INV-modor-vokot (readme heuristic concat) and INV-napap-tatup (centrality field-name mismatch). A shared normalizer + a typed SketchPrecomputed dataclass would address all three together. No matching IDF / TF-IDF item exists in the active set."  # 5673
